---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — ZeroMotion" description="ZeroMotion Marketing Terms of Service - Complete terms governing our digital marketing services, AI automation, and web development. Includes liability limitations and service disclaimers.">
  <main class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="h2 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-white/85 mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you and ZeroMotion Marketing ("we," "us," or "our") governing your use of our digital marketing services, AI-powered automation tools, web development services, and any related products or services (collectively, the "Services").
      </p>

      <div class="mb-10 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="h3 text-primary">Last Updated: {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</h2>
        <p class="text-white/85">
          These Terms are effective as of the date above. By accessing or using our Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our Services.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/85">
          These Terms include important provisions regarding limitations of liability, indemnification, dispute resolution, and your rights and obligations. Please read them carefully.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">1. Services Description</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Digital Marketing Services</h3>
            <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
              ZeroMotion provides comprehensive digital marketing solutions including but not limited to:
            </p>
            <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2">
              <li>• AI-powered website design and development</li>
              <li>• Search engine optimization (SEO) services</li>
              <li>• Social media marketing and advertising</li>
              <li>• Content creation and marketing automation</li>
              <li>• Email marketing campaigns and CRM setup</li>
              <li>• Pay-per-click (PPC) advertising management</li>
              <li>• Analytics and performance tracking</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-yellow-400">Important Service Disclaimer</h3>
            <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
              <strong>Results May Vary:</strong> While we strive to deliver high-quality marketing services, we cannot guarantee specific results, ROI, or business outcomes. Digital marketing success depends on numerous factors including market conditions, competition, budget allocation, and client cooperation.
            </p>
            <p class="text-white/85">
              All services are provided on an "as-is" basis with no guarantees of performance, rankings, conversions, or financial returns.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">2. Limitation of Liability</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h3 class="h4 text-red-400">Important Liability Limitations</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Maximum Liability Cap</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85">
                In no event shall ZeroMotion Marketing, its directors, employees, partners, agents, suppliers, or affiliates be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including without limitation, loss of profits, data, use, goodwill, or other intangible losses, resulting from your use of our Services.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Liability Limitation</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85">
                Our total liability to you for all claims arising from or relating to these Terms or our Services shall not exceed the amount paid by you to us in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Services "As Is"</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85">
                All services are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">3. Indemnification</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h3 class="h4 text-orange-400">Your Indemnification Obligations</h3>

          <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
            You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless ZeroMotion Marketing, its officers, directors, employees, agents, licensors, and suppliers from and against all losses, expenses, damages, and costs, including reasonable attorneys' fees, resulting from:
          </p>

          <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-3">
            <li>
              <strong>Content Violations:</strong> Any claim arising from content you provide that infringes intellectual property rights, violates laws, or breaches these Terms
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Third-Party Claims:</strong> Any claim by third parties related to your use of our Services, including claims from competitors, customers, or regulatory authorities
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Legal Non-Compliance:</strong> Any violation of applicable laws, regulations, or third-party rights in connection with your use of our Services
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Business Disputes:</strong> Any disputes arising from your business relationships, transactions, or marketing activities
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">4. Payment Terms</h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Service Fees and Billing</h3>
            <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2">
              <li>• Monthly subscription fees are billed in advance</li>
              <li>• Advertising spend is billed separately based on actual costs</li>
              <li>• One-time setup fees may apply for certain services</li>
              <li>• All fees are exclusive of applicable taxes</li>
              <li>• Payment is due upon receipt of invoice</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Cancellation and Refunds</h3>
            <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2">
              <li>• Subscription cancellations are effective at the end of the current billing cycle</li>
              <li>• No refunds for partial months or unused services</li>
              <li>• Setup fees are non-refundable</li>
              <li>• Advertising spend is non-refundable once campaigns are launched</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">5. Contact Information</h2>

        <div>
          <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
            If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:
          </p>

          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-primary">Business Contact</h4>
              <div class="space-y-2 text-white/85">
                <p><strong>Company:</strong> ZeroMotion Marketing</p>
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:zeromotionmarketing@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">zeromotionmarketing@gmail.com</a></p>
                <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+19853032016" class="text-primary hover:underline">(985) 303-2016</a></p>
                <p><strong>Address:</strong> Houma, Louisiana, USA</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-primary">Legal Contact</h4>
              <div class="space-y-2 text-white/85">
                <p><strong>Legal Department:</strong> zeromotionmarketing@gmail.com</p>
                <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 5 business days</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

